    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI Email Processing\n\n**Purpose:**\nSends an FOI applicant email (for example a payment request or payment receipt) through the FOI API and, when IMAP is enabled, records the acknowledgement.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI Fee Processing. Inputs: `templateName`, `previousStatus`, `serviceKey`, `foiRequestId`, `ministryRequestId`, `applicantCorrespondenceId`.\n\n**Processing:**\nBuilds the email payload (template name and applicant correspondence ID for correspondence, PAYONLINE or PAYOUTSTANDING emails) and sends the email. If the n8n variable `isIMAPEnabled` is \"True\", it waits 10 seconds and then sends the email acknowledgement.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nBoth calls go through FOI Backend API Manager(categories `foiemail` and `foiemail-ack`).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d43e6d1e-b123-4266-beee-5a6f43b81213",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1600,
        -400
      ]
    }
